WEBVTT

02:25:51.000 --> 02:25:52.000
That's it!

02:25:52.500 --> 02:25:53.625
Show the same courage.

02:25:54.417 --> 02:25:55.542
The Saturday guy will be found.

02:25:56.209 --> 02:25:58.209
-They'll kill him once they find him.
-Let them!

02:25:58.750 --> 02:25:59.709
What's your problem?

02:26:00.625 --> 02:26:01.917
Why do we care if he dies?

02:26:03.084 --> 02:26:06.125
We'll get him caught, go
inside, and weep like always.

02:26:06.625 --> 02:26:09.084
-Simple, right?
-That was before.
